{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56574","headline":"九转诗 二 · 窦真君","name":"九转诗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"却取抽成汞，还烧遣作砂。\n上仙方秘密，中禁药精华。\n紫炁含真色，朱光杂晓霞。\n欲将同一体，须更猛三花。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦真君","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}